00:19:50.760 --> 00:20:01.580
Oh, yeah. At least they were smart enough to be like, well, if people haven't figured it out yet, they might come across this villager in the mansion itself, and that person will ask them if they want to buy an oak stake, and they might just buy it out of curiosity.

00:20:01.660 --> 00:20:05.820
