This is a completely different level of ambiguousness.

00:20:35.060 --> 00:20:38.740
Yes. And it's also like you're being given information.

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:44.980
So if you did write down, let's say you made a journal of everything that everyone wrote you, said to you in the game.

00:20:45.340 --> 00:20:49.300
If you looked at those clues, some of them would still never line up with anything.

