And you might think like, well, I have to do something with this clue.

00:20:53.240 --> 00:20:56.340
Like it's never, it hasn't had any use yet.

00:20:56.460 --> 00:20:58.680
And it turns out it just will never have any use.

00:20:58.680 --> 00:21:09.020
And that is also really bad game design in the sense of misleading your players into thinking they haven't done something in a game that has missable collectibles.

00:21:09.020 --> 00:21:39.000
And that is also really bad game design in the game that has missed the game that has missed the game.

00:21:39.000 --> 00:22:08.980
And that is also really bad game design in the game that has missed the game.

00:22:10.540 --> 00:22:12.760
So obviously we don't think this is okay.

00:22:13.260 --> 00:22:15.600
Like this is not a mechanic that we're dealing with.

00:22:17.120 --> 00:22:22.620
So is this the point where all of us kind of said like, well, we're playing this for the show.

00:22:22.820 --> 00:22:25.440
We played 140 plus games at this point.

