Leveling and grinding, if you will, for hearts and for, like, Simon has, like, a level up ability in this game.

00:28:06.840 --> 00:28:10.980
Unlike most RPGs, though, you don't gain experience by killing monsters.

00:28:10.980 --> 00:28:15.080
It's only when you collect hearts from the monsters that you get the points.

00:28:15.080 --> 00:28:18.400
So you can't just go around constantly destroying skeletons.

00:28:18.400 --> 00:28:20.540
