00:28:20.860 --> 00:28:26.260
You earn one less experience point than the number of hearts you collected.

00:28:26.260 --> 00:28:32.620
So I think if it's, like, if it's a full heart, that's six hearts that go into your currency of hearts.

00:28:32.740 --> 00:28:35.900
