00:31:25.120 --> 00:31:30.320
So like it's a definitely it's definitely a cool thing to implement in a game like this.

00:31:30.320 --> 00:31:42.620
But the fact that you're usually killing enemies that are right next to you anyway, it seems like an unnecessary step to because you're just going to walk across the heart immediately most of the time.

00:31:42.760 --> 00:31:45.280
So it seems weird that they tied it to that.

00:31:46.120 --> 00:31:47.460
