I declare

00:56:18.720 --> 00:56:20.740
Castlevania 2

00:56:20.740 --> 00:56:22.600
Simon's quest

00:56:22.600 --> 00:56:24.040
officially

00:56:24.040 --> 00:56:25.420
essential.

